      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes! This please! Being able to auto atlas all the textures to a model without going through Blender would be a dream come true. And please do this for more than just avatars, my world has objects that contain several materials, so being able to atlas everything to just one texture and keeping transparency would be something of a miracle.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
