      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes! And a simple way to make sure this does not affect shaders much would be for it to check that all textures to be atlassed use the same shader. The setting should also be enabled by default, so people who don't know what they're doing get the most optimised avatars by default. More advanced users who see it causing issues could change the setting as necessary.",
