      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b81aa8964ecac2f8b14382e|full_name}: Problem is, the majority of people won't use a separate program like that (or a Unity addon, or what not). The point would be for it to be a very minimal effort thing, (hopefully even automated for most cases) integrated right into the SDK, so that EVERYONE would use it.",
